{"2846770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stop The F", "steam_appid": 2846770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles using the camera that can capture objects in subspace and place them wherever you want. Also your device  has various modifications which can extend its functionality. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/8e51bc55f044b0be26314799a7a955a9.poster.avif?t=1778778595\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/8e51bc55f044b0be26314799a7a955a9.webm?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/8e51bc55f044b0be26314799a7a955a9.mp4?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <i>test subject with a wonderful name Eve</i>, who has woken up on a fake island inside the colossal scientific complex. You will have to complete tests. Why are you here? What's happened to employees? You will get answers to these questions and many others. However, be vigilant, your curiosity can lead to dangerous <span class=\"bb_strike\">unforeseen</span> <i>prescribed consequences.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/0cf8a54c3ae0224df555c150ea8682d8.poster.avif?t=1778778595\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/0cf8a54c3ae0224df555c150ea8682d8.webm?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/0cf8a54c3ae0224df555c150ea8682d8.mp4?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack, created specifically for the game, will support you at every step, while PSX-inspired aesthetic graphics will allow you to feel the contrast between the unexplored? dark backstage and liminal tests more clearly.<br>The combination of a unique retro-futuristic style and music creates a special unforgettable atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/00f43fb03fe1a2c152cabbd04be06483.poster.avif?t=1778778595\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/00f43fb03fe1a2c152cabbd04be06483.webm?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/00f43fb03fe1a2c152cabbd04be06483.mp4?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>True fans of Portal Duology will enjoy our take on reimagining F-Stop</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project aims to recreate and reimagine F-stop, a canceled prequel to Valve’s Portal. While Stop The F draws direct inspiration from it, it is ultimately an original creation by an indie team, crafted with its own vision and identity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/fd9db37d7f9b5b54a7e5077d591bb239.poster.avif?t=1778778595\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/fd9db37d7f9b5b54a7e5077d591bb239.webm?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/fd9db37d7f9b5b54a7e5077d591bb239.mp4?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/35df8678a4829f20f0164892bbe17e25.poster.avif?t=1778778595\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/35df8678a4829f20f0164892bbe17e25.webm?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/35df8678a4829f20f0164892bbe17e25.mp4?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles using the camera that can capture objects in subspace and place them wherever you want. Also your device  has various modifications which can extend its functionality. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/8e51bc55f044b0be26314799a7a955a9.poster.avif?t=1778778595\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/8e51bc55f044b0be26314799a7a955a9.webm?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/8e51bc55f044b0be26314799a7a955a9.mp4?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <i>test subject with a wonderful name Eve</i>, who has woken up on a fake island inside the colossal scientific complex. You will have to complete tests. Why are you here? What's happened to employees? You will get answers to these questions and many others. However, be vigilant, your curiosity can lead to dangerous <span class=\"bb_strike\">unforeseen</span> <i>prescribed consequences.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/0cf8a54c3ae0224df555c150ea8682d8.poster.avif?t=1778778595\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/0cf8a54c3ae0224df555c150ea8682d8.webm?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/0cf8a54c3ae0224df555c150ea8682d8.mp4?t=1778778595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack, created specifically for the game, will support you at every step, while PSX-inspired aesthetic graphics will allow you to feel the contrast between the unexplored? dark backstage and liminal tests more clearly.<br>The combination of a unique retro-futuristic style and music creates a special unforgettable atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/00f43fb03fe1a2c152cabbd04be06483.poster.avif?t=1778778595\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"h